WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.634 --> 00:00:02.701
-Today is Friday,
and that's usually when

00:00:02.701 --> 00:00:03.968
I catch up on
some personal stuff --

00:00:03.968 --> 00:00:05.501
you know, I check my inbox,
return some e-mails,

00:00:05.501 --> 00:00:07.434
and then, of course,
I send out thank you notes.

00:00:07.434 --> 00:00:09.968
And I was running
a bit behind today.

00:00:09.968 --> 00:00:11.400
I thought
if you guys wouldn't mind,

00:00:11.400 --> 00:00:13.133
I'd like to write out my weekly
thank you notes right now.

00:00:13.133 --> 00:00:14.234
Is that okay with you?

00:00:14.234 --> 00:00:16.434
[ Applause ]
Thank you.

00:00:16.434 --> 00:00:19.067
James, can I get some thank you
note writing music, please?

00:00:19.067 --> 00:00:21.567
[ Gentle music plays ]

00:00:21.567 --> 00:00:23.100
♪♪

00:00:23.100 --> 00:00:24.567
-You think he had
that Nyquil chicken?

00:00:24.567 --> 00:00:26.701
-Yeah, I don't know.
He just seems sleepy.

00:00:26.701 --> 00:00:29.634
-Wow. Real sleepy.
-A little sleepy tonight, yeah.

00:00:29.634 --> 00:00:31.033
[ Gentle music plays ]

00:00:31.033 --> 00:00:33.033
Thank you, candy apples,

00:00:33.033 --> 00:00:35.267
for combining the joys
of eating something sweet

00:00:35.267 --> 00:00:37.300
with the opportunity to
break all of my teeth.

00:00:37.300 --> 00:00:40.167
[ Applause ]

00:00:42.634 --> 00:00:44.067
[ Gentle music plays ]

00:00:44.067 --> 00:00:46.501
Thank you,
"Don't Worry Darling,"

00:00:46.501 --> 00:00:49.567
for being a gripping drama
full of twists and turns...

00:00:49.567 --> 00:00:51.067
and the movie looks good, too.

00:00:51.067 --> 00:00:53.267
[ Applause ]

00:00:57.834 --> 00:00:59.467
[ Gentle music plays ]

00:00:59.467 --> 00:01:02.300
Thank you, clear recycling bags,

00:01:02.300 --> 00:01:03.434
or as I like to call you,

00:01:03.434 --> 00:01:05.400
trash aquariums.

00:01:05.400 --> 00:01:06.901
[ Applause ]

00:01:09.300 --> 00:01:12.667
-Oh, an apple core.
-I like that one.

00:01:12.667 --> 00:01:14.000
[ Gentle music plays ]

00:01:14.000 --> 00:01:15.734
This one's a thinker.
-This one's a thinker?

00:01:15.734 --> 00:01:17.234
-Yeah, I just thought --
-This isn't...

00:01:17.234 --> 00:01:19.167
-I thought of it now,
but this one's a thinker.

00:01:19.167 --> 00:01:20.634
-'Cause you're thinking of these
on the spot.

00:01:20.634 --> 00:01:21.934
-Correct.

00:01:21.934 --> 00:01:23.934
-You're just writing your
weekly gratitude list right now,

00:01:23.934 --> 00:01:25.767
so the one you just thought of

00:01:25.767 --> 00:01:26.767
is a thinker?

00:01:26.767 --> 00:01:28.100
Okay.

00:01:28.100 --> 00:01:29.634
-The one I thought of,
about to write, is a thinker.

00:01:29.634 --> 00:01:30.701
-Yeah. Not pre-written.

00:01:30.701 --> 00:01:32.968
-No, no.

00:01:32.968 --> 00:01:35.267
I'm writing them now
with ink from this

00:01:35.267 --> 00:01:36.634
[Rolling Rs] herrre pen.

00:01:36.634 --> 00:01:39.367
-Yes.
-[ Clears throat loudly ]

00:01:39.367 --> 00:01:42.734
-La plume.
-Mm, la plume.

00:01:42.734 --> 00:01:44.434
-Le crayon.

00:01:44.434 --> 00:01:45.801
[ Gentle music plays ]

00:01:45.801 --> 00:01:47.834
-Thank you, waffles,

00:01:47.834 --> 00:01:51.000
for being squares in triangles
in circles.

00:01:51.000 --> 00:01:53.501
[ Laughter ]

00:01:53.501 --> 00:01:55.033
[ Applause ]

00:01:55.634 --> 00:01:57.634
-Niceeee.

00:01:57.634 --> 00:01:59.634
[ Applause ]

00:01:59.634 --> 00:02:02.100
Euclid said, A plus.

00:02:02.100 --> 00:02:04.033
[ Laughter ]

00:02:06.200 --> 00:02:07.200
[ Gentle music plays, stops ]
-Is this one a thinker too?

00:02:07.200 --> 00:02:10.100
Or no?
-What's that? No.

00:02:10.100 --> 00:02:11.367
[ Gentle music plays ]

00:02:11.367 --> 00:02:14.334
Thank you, new Star Wars show,
"Andor,"

00:02:14.334 --> 00:02:17.167
for sounding like someone
at Disney Plus ran out of names.

00:02:17.167 --> 00:02:20.534
"Uh, it's about...
spaceships and/or, uh..."

00:02:20.534 --> 00:02:22.200
[ Laughter ]

00:02:23.000 --> 00:02:28.100
"Droids and/or..."
-Star Wars, right?

00:02:28.100 --> 00:02:29.634
[ Gentle music plays ]

00:02:29.634 --> 00:02:32.767
-Thank you, boba, for combining
the taste of tea

00:02:32.767 --> 00:02:35.968
with the thrill of accidentally
choking on a tapioca ball.

00:02:35.968 --> 00:02:37.901
[ Laughter ]

00:02:37.901 --> 00:02:39.300
[ Applause ]

00:02:39.300 --> 00:02:41.667
-[ Gagging ]

00:02:41.667 --> 00:02:43.634
[ Coughing ]

00:02:44.701 --> 00:02:46.167
-There you go.
-Bubble tea.

00:02:46.167 --> 00:02:48.601
-Mm.

00:02:48.601 --> 00:02:49.701
[ Gentle music plays ]

00:02:49.701 --> 00:02:51.434
Thank you, pumpkins,

00:02:51.434 --> 00:02:54.367
for being a 360-degree butt.

00:02:54.367 --> 00:02:56.801
[ Laughter ]

00:02:56.801 --> 00:03:00.067
[ Rim shot plays ]

00:03:00.601 --> 00:03:02.000
Come on, man. Come on.

00:03:02.000 --> 00:03:03.567
-Come on! Grow up!

00:03:03.567 --> 00:03:05.033
-Come on. Come on.
-Grow up!

00:03:05.033 --> 00:03:08.167
[ Laughter ]

00:03:08.167 --> 00:03:09.534
[ Gentle music plays ]

00:03:09.534 --> 00:03:12.834
-Thank you, soup, for not
going by your original name,

00:03:12.834 --> 00:03:14.334
"a hot, pureed salad."

00:03:14.334 --> 00:03:16.467
There you have it, everybody.
Those are our thank you notes.

